# Project specific exceptions
# ==============================================================================
# Ignore all generated PDFs except in specific build directories
**/*.pdf
**/main.pdf
!01-ats-resume/builds/*.pdf
!02-visual-resume/builds/*.pdf
!03-cover-letters/*/builds/*.pdf
!04-role-based-resumes/*/builds/*.pdf